'下限須低於上限':['The lower limit must be below the upper limit','Dapat mas mababa ang minimum kaysa maximum'],
'怎樣中獎？':['How do I win?','Paano manalo?'],
'盤面為 5 列 × 4 行，共 1024 ways。相同符號由最左列開始，連續出現在至少 3 列即可中獎，不需要同一行。各列可用位置數相乘，就是中獎 ways。':['The board has 5 reels and 4 rows, giving 1024 ways. Match the same symbol on at least 3 consecutive reels from the leftmost reel. Symbols need not share a row. Multiply the matching positions on each reel to calculate winning ways.','May 5 reel at 4 na hanay ang board, para sa 1024 ways. Itugma ang parehong simbolo sa hindi bababa sa 3 magkasunod na reel mula sa kaliwa. Hindi kailangang iisang hanay. I-multiply ang bilang ng katugmang puwesto sa bawat reel para makuha ang winning ways.'],
'金牌及 WILD':['Gold cards & WILD','Gold card at WILD'],
'金牌只會出現在第 2–4 列。金牌參與中獎後轉成天使或惡魔 WILD。WILD 可替代普通符號，不能替代 CARROT。惡魔會將第 2–5 列的 1–4 個合資格普通牌位轉為惡魔 WILD；不取代 CARROT 或已有 WILD。':['Gold cards appear only on reels 2–4. Winning gold cards become Angel or Devil WILDs. WILD replaces regular symbols, but not CARROT. Devil turns 1–4 eligible regular positions on reels 2–5 into Devil WILDs; it does not replace CARROT or existing WILDs.','Sa reel 2–4 lamang lumalabas ang gold card. Ang nanalong gold card ay nagiging Angel o Devil WILD. Pumapalit ang WILD sa regular na simbolo, ngunit hindi sa CARROT. Ginagawang Devil WILD ng Devil ang 1–4 na puwedeng regular na puwesto sa reel 2–5; hindi nito pinapalitan ang CARROT o kasalukuyang WILD.'],
'消除與倍率':['Cascades & multipliers','Pagpalit ng baraha at multiplier'],
'中獎普通牌消除，新牌由上方落入原空位。未中獎牌留在原位。普通遊戲倍率依序 ×1、×2、×3、×5；下一次付費旋轉重置。':['Winning regular cards clear and new cards drop into their spaces from above. Non-winning cards stay in place. Base-game multipliers progress through ×1, ×2, ×3 and ×5, resetting on the next paid spin.','Nawawala ang nanalong regular na baraha at bumabagsak mula sa itaas ang kapalit. Nananatili ang hindi nanalong baraha. Sunod-sunod na ×1, ×2, ×3 at ×5 ang regular na multiplier; nagre-reset sa susunod na may bayad na spin.'],
'CARROT 與免費遊戲':['CARROT & free spins','CARROT at libreng spin'],
'同一盤面有 3 個或以上 CARROT，獲得 10 次免費遊戲；免費遊戲中再出現 3 個或以上，加 5 次。免費倍率為 ×2、×4、×6、×10。同一次旋轉只發放一次 CARROT 獎勵，避免保留符號重複觸發。':['At least 3 CARROTs on the same board award 10 free spins. Landing at least 3 again during free spins adds 5. Free-spin multipliers are ×2, ×4, ×6 and ×10. CARROT rewards are awarded only once per spin, so retained symbols cannot trigger repeated awards.','Ang 3 o higit pang CARROT sa iisang board ay nagbibigay ng 10 libreng spin. Kapag may 3 o higit pa muli habang libre, dagdag na 5 spin. Ang mga multiplier ay ×2, ×4, ×6 at ×10. Isang beses lang ibinibigay ang CARROT reward bawat spin upang hindi paulit-ulit mag-trigger ang nanatiling simbolo.'],
'蘿蔔與下注':['Carrots & bets','Carrots at mga taya'],
'每次付費下注最多為當時餘額的 10%。免費遊戲沿用觸發局下注額，不扣蘿蔔。Auto 每次開始前重新檢查上限。加減依目前餘額的0.1%換算、按0.2取整，長按可連續調整；BET 可快選比例或輸入精確金額。':['Each paid bet is capped at 10% of the current balance. Free spins use the triggering bet without charging carrots. Auto checks the limit before each spin. The +/− step is 0.1% of balance, rounded to 0.2; hold to repeat. Select BET for preset percentages or an exact amount.','Hanggang 10% ng kasalukuyang balanse ang bawat may bayad na taya. Ginagamit ng libreng spin ang nag-trigger na taya, nang walang bawas na carrots. Sinusuri ng Auto ang limitasyon bago bawat spin. Tig-0.1% ng balanse ang +/−, niro-round sa 0.2; pindutin nang matagal para tuloy-tuloy. Piliin ang BET para sa porsiyento o eksaktong halaga.'],
'100 萬起以 M／B／T 顯示，小數固定三位。點擊餘額、本局獎勵或右上本次淨輸贏可查看完整金額。本次淨輸贏以此分頁開啟時的餘額為基準，重新整理後保留。':['Amounts from one million use M/B/T with three decimal places. Select the balance, round win or session net to see full amounts. Session net uses the balance when this tab opened and survives refresh.','M/B/T at tatlong decimal ang gamit mula isang milyon. Piliin ang balanse, panalo sa round o netong resulta para makita ang buong halaga. Batay ang netong resulta sa balanse nang buksan ang tab at nananatili kapag ni-refresh.'],
'私人試玩版：測試蘿蔔只保存在此瀏覽器，不能充值、兌現或轉移。目前採自訂固定列權重模型，非 JILI 原版概率。參考模擬：固定下注20、100萬次付費局並計入免費回合，RTP估計96.55%，95%信賴區間約95.55%–97.56%；不是已認證理論值。下注以0.2為單位，避免極小下注逐筆四捨五入失真。':['Private playtest: test carrots are stored only in this browser and cannot be purchased, cashed out or transferred. This is a custom fixed reel-weight model, not JILI’s original probabilities. A simulation of one million paid rounds at a fixed bet of 20, including free rounds, estimated RTP at 96.55%, with an approximate 95% confidence interval of 95.55%–97.56%. This is not a certified theoretical RTP. Bets use 0.2 increments to avoid rounding distortion at tiny stakes.','Pribadong pagsubok: sa browser lamang naka-save ang test carrots at hindi puwedeng bilhin, i-cash out o ilipat. Sariling modelo ito na may nakapirming timbang bawat reel, hindi ang orihinal na posibilidad ng JILI. Sa simulation ng isang milyong may bayad na round na tig-20 ang taya, kasama ang libreng round, tinatayang 96.55% ang RTP; humigit-kumulang 95.55%–97.56% ang 95% confidence interval. Hindi ito sertipikadong theoretical RTP. Tig-0.2 ang taya upang maiwasan ang pagbaluktot dahil sa rounding ng napakaliit na taya.'],
'玩法':['Rules','Mga tuntunin'],
