'計算方法':['Payout calculation','Pagkuwenta ng bayad'],
'同符號獎勵＝賠付值 × 中獎 ways × 下注額 × 當前倍率。多種符號中獎分別計算再相加，金額以兩位小數記錄。':['Symbol win = paytable value × winning ways × bet × current multiplier. Wins from different symbols are calculated separately and added. Amounts are recorded to two decimal places.','Panalo sa simbolo = halaga sa paytable × winning ways × taya × kasalukuyang multiplier. Hiwalay na kinukuwenta at pinagsasama ang iba’t ibang panalo. Dalawang decimal ang tala ng halaga.'],
'例：下注 20、A 連續 3 列各有 1、2、1 個可用位置，ways＝1×2×1＝2。當前倍率 ×2，獎勵＝0.5×2×20×2＝40 蘿蔔。':['Example: bet 20; A appears in 1, 2 and 1 matching positions on 3 consecutive reels. Ways = 1×2×1 = 2. At multiplier ×2, the win is 0.5×2×20×2 = 40 carrots.','Halimbawa: taya 20; may 1, 2 at 1 katugmang puwesto ng A sa 3 magkasunod na reel. Ways = 1×2×1 = 2. Sa multiplier na ×2, panalo = 0.5×2×20×2 = 40 carrots.'],
